#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to Dovecot"
msgstr "Introdução ao Dovecot"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/dovecot.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Dovecot</application> is an Internet Message Access Protocol "
"(IMAP) and Post Office Protocol (POP) server, written primarily with "
"security in mind. <application>Dovecot</application> aims to be lightweight,"
" fast and easy to set up as well as highly configurable and easily "
"extensible with plugins."
msgstr ""
"O &quot;<application>Dovecot</application>&quot; é um servidor "
"&quot;Internet Message Access Protocol&quot; (&quot;IMAP&quot;) e &quot;Post"
" Office Protocol&quot; (&quot;POP&quot;), escrito principalmente com a "
"segurança em mente. &quot;<application>Dovecot</application>&quot; pretende "
"ser leve, rápido e fácil de configurar, bem como altamente configurável e "
"facilmente extensível com &quot;plug-ins&quot;."

